      "rating": 5,
      "reviewer": "Shelby Grantham",
      "date": "2026-10-18T19:35:00Z",
      "text": "Dr. Bose has been our family dentist for three years and still remembers which of my kids hates the mint polish. Lupe did my cleaning and explained why my gums bleed on one side. Small office, no rush, and they run on time.",
