      "site": "facebook",
      "rating": 2,
      "reviewer": "Rodney Battle",
      "date": "2026-09-29T20:25:00Z",
      "text": "Nice people, but I was surprised by a $95 charge for an extra x-ray that my plan didn't cover. Please tell patients before you take it, not at checkout.",
